[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 7933.03, "timestamp": "02:12:13", "text": "どうやって友達を作るのですか？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7937.51, "timestamp": "02:12:17", "text": "実は"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7938.55, "timestamp": "02:12:18", "text": "友達の作り方がわからないんです。 それはクリッククリック、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7941.301, "timestamp": "02:12:21", "text": "えーと上、えーと左、えーと上"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7943.83, "timestamp": "02:12:23", "text": "[鼻を鳴らす]右、友達のやつです。  IDを検索してください"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7950.629, "timestamp": "02:12:30", "text": "うん。   届きましたか"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7951.83, "timestamp": "02:12:31", "text": "？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7952.149, "timestamp": "02:12:32", "text": "うん。   そうそう"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7956.149, "timestamp": "02:12:36", "text": "。 それで、ええと、そういうことがあって、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7957.669, "timestamp": "02:12:37", "text": "そう、検索する必要があるんです。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7964.629, "timestamp": "02:12:44", "text": "IDを送ってくれ。さもないと死ぬことになるぞ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7976.31, "timestamp": "02:12:56", "text": "バカだな。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7979.109, "timestamp": "02:12:59", "text": "えっと、"}]